# Found by the final review: nothing checked in_ready against the input FIFO's full flag.
id: M15
desc: in_ready drops when the input FIFO is empty and the output FIFO is full (source stalled for no reason)
intended: a_ready_def
edit: rtl/alu_fifo_top.sv
  find: assign in_ready    = !in_full;
  replace: assign in_ready    = !in_full && !(in_empty && out_full);
